// The collision, and nothing else. `q` is the same NAME the generic methods in
// main.bit give their `Option<T>` parameter; its TYPE is irrelevant (the ticket
// measured `int`, `string` and a class, all reproducing). A LOCAL named `q`
// here does NOT reproduce, so this must stay a PARAMETER.
fn other(q: int): int {
  return q + 1
}
